Package: volparossa
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: VOLPAROSSA contributors
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: ca-certificates, libc6 (>= 2.36), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, systemd, iproute2, nftables
Recommends: wireguard-tools
Description: decentralised policy-enforcing VPN overlay (development build)
 VOLPAROSSA targets client-to-relay-to-exit paths using kernel WireGuard,
 Linux MPTCP, MASQUE, and genuine Multipath QUIC. Relay and exit roles are
 disabled by default. This package is not release-ready until the repository's
 acceptance status is complete.
